				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>To set up this reminder to run automatically every two weeks:
1. Open the Shortcuts app on your device and tap the 'Automation' tab at the bottom.
2. Tap '+' to create a new automation.
3. Select 'Time of Day' and set the time you want to receive the reminder.
4. Under 'Repeat', select 'Weekly' and change the interval from 'Every Week' to 'Every 2 Weeks'.
5. Set the start date to tomorrow.
6. Under 'Actions', search for 'Run Shortcut' and select this shortcut.
7. Ensure 'Run Immediately' is checked so that the text and push notification send seamlessly without asking.</string>
